//   npx tsx scripts/cyrus/learning-report.ts --input rows.json --json          (summary JSON to stdout)
// Options: --since YYYY-MM-DD, --out FILE (default stdout), --input FILE, --json, --sheet FILE (default services/modbuilder/sheets/1.21.11.md),
// --include-prompts (needed only for corrections wording in the mining job). Database: CYRUS_DATABASE_URL, else DATABASE_URL.
